  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B4D CSR R&#xe4;ddaBarnen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B4D CSR Save the Children - B4D CSR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Child Rights and Business Program&quot; F&#xf6;rslaget fokuserar p&#xe5; att (i)     st&#xe4;rka nuvarande program i Kina samt ev. utveckla en s.k. hub i Asien  (ii) st&#xe4;rka svenska och utl&#xe4;ndska f&#xf6;retags kapacitet att applicera   internationella standards vad g&#xe4;ller barns r&#xe4;ttigheter, (iii)         utarbeta en praktiskt inriktad s.k. toolbox/verktygsl&#xe5;da f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;retag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation with Swedish Save the Children re &quot;Child Rights and       Business Program&quot;. Focusing on (1) include child rights in corporate  responsibility reporting (2) increase awareness among business actors re child rights (3) integrating child rights approach in the          operations of business (4) increased capacity of Save the Children to support businesses worldwide to integrate child rights in operations.</narrative>
  </description>
